	(text "Protected overcurrent scale"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 169 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ad4158d-8323-484b-9d83-639923bf4e50")
	)
	(text "At +16.5 V sense, IN+ is at most about 2.76 V, inside the\nvalid common-mode range for IO3V3 >= 3.135 V. Negative\nsaturation or a powered-off comparator is current limited\nby the input resistors; calculated clamp current is below\n0.5 mA versus the 10 mA absolute limit. Normal source\nsense and limit are 0..1 V. Do not use the fault\ncomparator as a calibrated low-current meter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.33 174.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "10d871a9-7eee-4a3f-9aa0-76f333ea8d61")
	)
	(text "Write overcurrent trip, fault memory and power inhibit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 14.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1c66899e-51f8-4351-b4f5-6bf8d5355a6d")
	)
	(text "FPGA fault output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 29.21 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "289e98e4-84f7-4382-867e-b80c3faf85ed")
	)
	(text "U2201 keeps analog qualification: MAT_OC_TRIP =\nMAT_CMP_RAW & MAT_WRITE_SAFE. U2203 ORs this event with\nMAT_CONFIG_TRIP from sheet 1300. Route/range/mode changes\nand service-DAC updates during intended WRITE now clock\nthe same fault memory as excess current. The configuration\nbranch is not masked by WRITE_SAFE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 174.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "37c1e0eb-8db6-4fc8-8a15-281d968f3b87")
	)
	(text "R2200/R2201 = 49.9k/10k divide normalized source-current\nsense by 5.99. R2202/R2203 = 37.4k/10k and R2211 = 1.5M\nfrom IO3V3 set the backup threshold. Nominal trip: VSENSE\n> 1.2571*VILIM + 0.10343 V. The CV/CC loop is the\nprecision current regulator; this comparator is\nindependent coarse shutdown."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 174.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4cee413d-b577-43a9-8e6e-f3db1b3d8f03")
	)
	(text "MATRIX_INHIBIT_N to Power / connector sheet 400"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.45 148.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "51bc2c66-5c34-4f3b-ba4f-c9bf88057efd")
	)
	(text "Local stop and Power inhibit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 169 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5262fb8f-db4d-4a0a-a697-9deab11c9f7d")
	)
	(text "Qualified trip event"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.67 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5e3ceae2-9811-4fc4-9ab6-c3dd12148bf1")
	)
	(text "MAT_FAULT_Q pulls MAT_FAULT_N low through Q2200 and drives\nQ2201/Q2202/Q2203 to assert MATRIX_INHIBIT_N to Power.\nLocal enable removal does not wait for MCU or ADC. Total\nshutdown delay includes sense amplifier, input RC,\ncomparator, gates, latch, source actuator and switch\ntiming; the 40 ns comparator headline is not the system\nstopping time."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 174.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c16e036-e495-4f03-bd4b-45020ee6af34")
	)
	(text "Fault memory and re-arm"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 255.27 169 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d702ecd-3b8c-4128-b646-1388a616513d")
	)
	(text "U2202 stores D=1 on a MAT_TRIP rising edge. PRE_N stays\nhigh; only CLR_N is asynchronous. R2204 defaults clear\nlow, also disabling MAT_ALLOWED on sheet 1300. Clear\nrelease alone cannot arm the matrix: source zero, a full\nvalidated 80-bit frame and protected LATCH are required.\nMeet latch clock-pulse and clear recovery/removal timing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 255.27 174.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "992b1abb-6207-42b2-a976-fc08dffc2e6e")
	)
	(text "Sense dividers and comparator"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "abc71125-153d-4aa6-a46d-4d3db62c1260")
	)
	(text "Analog and configuration trips"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 169 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b18cf9d6-c589-465f-9582-91b869b9f5af")
	)
